+Many of these changes are partially or entirely tunable via SAS defines in XML in [`GlobalDefines_advciv_sas.xml`](/Assets/XML/GlobalDefines_advciv_sas.xml).
+
+This means that even though this guide often mentions code places such as `CvUnitInfo::getTerrainAttackModifier`, effectively people don't need to modify the DLL (it would require a recompile of the source code to be effective anyway) but only modifying the corresponding SAS defines (such as `SAS_CV_UNIT_INFO_ENABLE_UNIT_TERRAIN_ATTACK_MODIFIERS`, set to 0 to disable or 1 to enable for example) to make a change, if such an option is provided.
+
+The aim is to make more and more options player-tunable via XML in SAS defines, but it is tedious and not always relevant or easy, so may not always be available, but hopefully quite a bit.
 
